 "name": "ST18EV_EVENT00.BBQ",
 "strings": [
  "",
  "The fighting in Southeast Asia",
  "had long been deadlocked,",
  "but the time came for it to move.",
  "There were two reasons it moved.",
  "One: Operation Odessa happened,",
  "and from Europe,",
  "no small number of Zeon soldiers",
  "had fled all the way",
  "to Southeast Asia.",
  "The other: the devil overhead,",
  "the mobile armor",
  "\"Apsaras,\"",
  "had at last been exposed",
  "by the 08th MS Team,",
  "with Shiro at its heart.",
  "What Is the Apsaras?",
  "The Southeast Asian Front",
  "The Apsaras.",
  "It is an MA.",
  "MA, or mobile armor, refers to",
  "a machine normally bigger than",
  "a mobile suit and not humanoid.",
  "Zeon, with a head start",
  "in operating and researching",
  "mobile suits, put the engineering",
  "limit of a humanoid mobile suit",
  "at roughly 100 tons dry weight.",
  "For anything larger,",
  "walking on the ground was hard",
  "and fuel use in space ballooned;",
  "because of these problems,",
  "Zeon had given up",
  "the humanoid form.",
  "In the One Year War,",
  "the Federation forces never",
  "managed to arrive at",
  "the concept of the mobile armor.",
  "The Apsaras",
  "was one type of MA.",
  "Originally,",
  "it was an MA meant to take Jaburo,",
  "but while Zeon held the upper hand",
  "its development lost priority,",
  "and work on it went on, modestly,",
  "here in Southeast Asia.",
  "Conceptually it was very simple:",
  "a large machine built to attack",
  "fortresses with a high-output",
  "beam cannon.",
  "The Big Zam was built",
  "for a similar purpose,",
  "but it walked on legs,",
  "making up for its lack of mobility",
  "with a barrier called an I-Field",
  "and plenty of anti-MS weapons.",
  "The Apsaras, by contrast,",
  "was built on the idea that",
  "with mobility, it would need",
  "no barrier or anti-MS arms,",
  "and so, though large, it was",
  "designed for high mobility.",
  "After the Battle of Odessa,",
  "things suddenly grew fiercer.",
  "Operation Odessa.",
  "In the One Year War,",
  "it was the turning point",
  "of the fighting on Earth.",
  "In this battle,",
  "Zeon's expedition to Europe",
  "suffered an irreparable blow,",
  "and its surviving",
  "men and MS fled in rout.",
  "And the Federation",
  "was left with vast ground forces.",
  "The Federation's moves",
  "were not fast,",
  "but not too slow, either.",
  "Before long,",
  "it launched a pursuit.",
  "In land warfare, the worst losses",
  "come not in the midst of battle",
  "but in the pursuit that falls on",
  "the beaten as they flee.",
  "Indeed, this time too,",
  "Zeon suffered heavy losses.",
  "Even several tactical nukes",
  "could not turn the tide;",
  "the Zeon forces were hounded",
  "and their losses mounted.",
  "In Southeast Asia there was a base",
  "for launches into space.",
  "The places the routed",
  "Zeon soldiers headed for",
  "were, without exception, places",
  "with launch bases, the way back",
  "to their home in space.",
  "The tide of war was turning fast.",
  "The upheaval at Odessa",
  "spread like wildfire worldwide.",
  "As a result,",
  "in Southeast Asia,",
  "Zeon, to turn things around,",
  "rushed to finish and launch",
  "the Apsaras, while the Federation",
  "kept up its relentless pursuit,",
  "seeking to widen its gains.",
  "If the soldiers could be stopped",
  "from escaping to space, the war",
  "might be brought to an end",
  "a month sooner.",
  "And fighting fiercer",
  "than anything before",
  "began to break out",
  "all across Southeast Asia.",
  "The Federation forces began",
  "to wipe out Zeon bases",
  "one by one,",
  "and Zeon answered",
  "with ferocious resistance.",
  "And a few bases in,",
  "the Federation would draw",
  "the winning ticket."
 ]
}
